Tanpa cokelat,

91
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,879
Orang tua ini menolak minum obatnya.

92
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,879
Carilah solusi.

93
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,319
Gou'er Ye.

94
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,360
Minumlah obatmu dulu.

95
00:04:45,519 --> 00:04:47,839
Setelah minum obat, aku akan membelikanmu bubur delapan harta karun.

96
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,720
Bebas gula.

97
00:04:48,879 --> 00:04:49,680
Apakah rasanya manis?

98
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:50,720
Ini manis.

99
00:04:51,079 --> 00:04:52,360
Ayo, minum obatnya dulu.

100
